          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Yrogin",
            text: _("Message from the queen, Your Highness! The boats are ready, but there is only a short window in which to act before Elensefar recovers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Poor timing; I’m a little busy at the moment..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("Still, Elensefar is too important a prize to let slip. I cannot risk Maddock regaining his footing before we have a chance to deal the finishing blow."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("I’ll depart immediately. Yrogin, you assume command here. It shouldn’t take much to defeat this con-man now that we’ve lured him into battle."),
          },
